{
  "format": "alexvolkihar-sokoban/storyboard",
  "version": 1,
  "_doc": [
    "Read by scripts/capture.py. Each shot or screenshot starts from 'start' (scene: main_menu, level_select, game, pause, replay, generate, benchmark, themes, settings, credits, end_card, theme_grid; game-like scenes take pack, level and 'played' = moves of the level's par already made, or 'lurd').",
    "Steps run in order on a 30 fps clock: {wait: s}, {key: name}, {keys: [names], every: s}, {lurd: moves, every: s}, {themes: [ids], every: s}, {join: true} (wait for the hint, random level or benchmark worker). 'every' defaults to 0.15 s.",
    "Video shots last 'seconds' and show 'caption' in a band under the game; screenshots hold 'hold_frames' frames (default 12) after their last step."
  ],
  "size": [1280, 720],
  "screenshot_size": [1280, 800],
  "fps": 30,
  "language": "en",
  "progress": {
    "completed": {
